# Project rules (minimal)

- Do not commit `data/skiba.ged` or other raw GEDCOM with living-person data.
- Do not recolor, redesign, or replace `assets/Image 1.png` (hero master). Use Image 2 only as layout reference.
- After changing `scripts/`, `content/`, or `assets/site.css`, run `python3 scripts/build_site.py` and commit the updated `index.html` when publishing.
- Publish to Pages only via allowlist: `index.html`, `.nojekyll`, `assets/hero-bg*.{avif,webp,jpg}` — never master PNGs or YAML/scripts.
- Keep the header to exactly seven nav items (О проекте … Контакты · Древо); no separate brand button in the nav bar.
- Prefer editing `content/content.yaml` for copy; keep genealogy facts in GEDCOM + `parse_gedcom.py` injection.
- For context in new chats, use `@assets/project-anchor.md` and `@docs/decisions.md`.
